# --- Runtime ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Render/Railway/Koyeb run this as a web service. One worker by design: the
# pipeline caches a fitted baseline in-process, and a second worker would build
# its own. Scale out with more instances, not more uvicorn workers.
web: uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port $PORT --timeout-keep-alive 65

# Releases run against a build-time $PORT that is not the runtime one, so this
# is only useful for explicit migrations on a real instance:
# release: alembic upgrade head